contentMarkdown:
This card holder can hold your business, fidelity and credit cards or any other similar format.  For testing purpose, I was able to put 2 cards by card-slot, and 4 cards on the sub-pocket. Which means 16 cards, even if I don't recommend doing it for usability purpose at the beginning, at least. (leather will stretch card by card)

This handmade wallet is from an original template from Corter Leather, it is an adaptation made by me designed to order for a specific use. The name is a tribute.

[The leather](notion:b82a8bf9ee1040e0816e7a0581027cbd) used named Pueblo has a marbled aspect that gives it a classy, grunge and unique visual. I use here the colors Violet and Ortensia in combination.

All the colours can be applied on this wallet, of course, compose your own.

## “Pelle” Certificate

{{image:1}}
This version of leather product comes with a first grade leather, a tannery from Toscany (Italy) that respects the [Consortium Manifesto](notion:4a58a7b015244c8ea0d583c45532c0d3). It’s proof of quality, and respect for nature.

